{"seq":1,"slug":"mutual-exclusion-failure","title":"互斥在 GC/网络分区下如何被破坏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-locks-coordination/why-locks-fail/mutual-exclusion-failure","wordCount":2212,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"互斥在-gc-网络分区下如何被破坏\">互斥在 GC/网络分区下如何被破坏</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>几乎所有分布式锁事故的根因都可以归到同一句话：<strong>客户端假设自己持有锁的整个时间段内，自己对锁的状态判断始终成立</strong>。这个假设在单机多线程环境里由操作系统保证——线程被调度器换出时会保存上下文，重新运行时不会以为自己还握着已经被别人拿走的互斥量。但跨进程、跨网络之后，这个保证消失了。一个进程可以在完全不知情的情况下「睡着了」，醒来后按自己记忆里的时间线继续执行，而锁早已在别处被重新分配。</p>\n<p>理解这件事需要引入一个显式模型：<strong>暂停模型（suspend model）</strong>。进程的执行不是连续的，而是由一段段执行窗口和穿插其中的不可知长度暂停组成。锁服务的视角和持锁进程的视角是两个独立的时间轴，二者之间没有共享的时钟、没有共享的中断通知。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[进程 P 请求锁] --&gt; B[锁服务授予锁 lease=10s]&#10;    B --&gt; C[P 开始执行临界区]&#10;    C --&gt; D{P 发生暂停}&#10;    D --&gt;|GC / 挂起 / 网络分区| E[暂停 25 秒&lt;br/&gt;P 无任何感知]&#10;    E --&gt; F[锁服务在 10s 时&lt;br/&gt;自动过期并授予 Q]&#10;    F --&gt; G[Q 进入临界区]&#10;    E --&gt; H[P 恢复执行&lt;br/&gt;仍以为自己持锁]&#10;    H --&gt; I[P 与 Q 同时写&lt;br/&gt;互斥被破坏]&#10;    G --&gt; I\">graph TD\n    A[进程 P 请求锁] --&gt; B[锁服务授予锁 lease=10s]\n    B --&gt; C[P 开始执行临界区]\n    C --&gt; D{P 发生暂停}\n    D --&gt;|GC / 挂起 / 网络分区| E[暂停 25 秒&lt;br/&gt;P 无任何感知]\n    E --&gt; F[锁服务在 10s 时&lt;br/&gt;自动过期并授予 Q]\n    F --&gt; G[Q 进入临界区]\n    E --&gt; H[P 恢复执行&lt;br/&gt;仍以为自己持锁]\n    H --&gt; I[P 与 Q 同时写&lt;br/&gt;互斥被破坏]\n    G --&gt; I</pre><p>这张图的每一格都对应真实故障：<code>D</code> 是 JVM 的 Full GC、虚拟机的 vMotion、容器的 CPU throttling、宿主机的内存换页，或者纯粹是网络分区让 P 与锁服务互相不可达。注意 <code>E</code> 到 <code>H</code> 之间 P 是「活着」的——它的线程栈、它的局部变量、它对「我持有锁」这个事实的信念都完好无损。破坏互斥的不是崩溃，而是<strong>暂停</strong>；崩溃反而是安全的，因为崩溃的进程不会再写数据。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>暂停来源</th>\n<th>典型时长量级</th>\n<th>进程是否感知</th>\n<th>常见误解</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>JVM Full GC</td>\n<td>数百 ms ~ 数十 s（堆越大越久）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>「我们设了 GC 参数所以不会停」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虚拟机挂起 / 迁移</td>\n<td>秒级 ~ 分钟级</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>「云上不会发生」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络分区</td>\n<td>直到恢复（可能数分钟）</td>\n<td>只能靠超时推断</td>\n<td>「分区时锁服务会通知我」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPU 超卖 / cgroup throttling</td>\n<td>数十 ms ~ 秒</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>「容器有独立 CPU」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磁盘 / 页面换页阻塞</td>\n<td>不可预测</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>「只是慢，逻辑没错」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进程被 SIGSTOP</td>\n<td>直到 SIGCONT</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>「调试时才用」</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键结论：<strong>所有这些暂停都无法被客户端通过代码消除</strong>。你能做的是把「暂停期间锁会怎样」变成设计的一部分，而不是假装它不存在。这就是后面两篇文档的主题——<a href=\"lease-heartbeat\">租约与心跳</a>解决「锁必须自动过期」，<a href=\"fencing-token\">Fencing Token</a> 解决「过期后旧持锁者仍在写」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gc-停顿如何击穿互斥\">GC 停顿如何击穿互斥</h2><p>JVM 的 stop-the-world 是最经典的场景，因为它在「正确配置」的系统里也会发生。设锁的 TTL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{ttl}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">ttl</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，临界区正常耗时为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{crit}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，一次 Full GC 的停顿为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{gc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。互斥被破坏的充分条件是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{gc} + T_{crit} &gt; T_{ttl}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">ttl</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>举个具体的：TTL 设 10 秒，临界区本身只要 50 毫秒，但只要发生一次 10 秒以上的 STW 停顿，锁就会在 P 的临界区执行到一半时过期。10 秒的 Full GC 听起来夸张，但在一台堆内存 32GB、使用 CMS 或大堆 G1 的服务上完全可能——只要一次并发模式失败（concurrent mode failure）就会退化成全堆压缩。</p>\n<p>更隐蔽的情况是临界区被拉长。如果临界区里有一次 RPC 调用、一次数据库慢查询、一次磁盘刷盘，临界区耗时就不再由你的代码决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{crit} = T_{local} + T_{rpc} + T_{io}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只要其中任意一项出现抖动，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{crit}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就可能从毫秒级跳到秒级。很多团队的处理方式是「把 TTL 设大一点」，这确实降低了破坏概率，但代价是故障恢复时间被同步拉长——持锁进程崩溃后，锁要等 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{ttl}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">ttl</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 才能被别人拿到。这个取舍在 <a href=\"lease-heartbeat\">租约与心跳</a> 中有详细展开。</p>\n<p>值得注意的是，GC 停顿还会破坏另一种东西：<strong>本地单调时钟的信任</strong>。有些实现会用 <code>System.nanoTime()</code> 判断「我持锁还没超时」，但暂停期间时钟仍在走，暂停结束后这个判断会得出错误结论。锁的过期判断必须由锁服务侧做出，客户端本地的计时只能作为提示。</p>\n<h2 id=\"网络分区如何制造双主\">网络分区如何制造双主</h2><p>网络分区的破坏方式与 GC 不同：进程没有暂停，它活得好好的，只是<strong>它和锁服务之间的网络断了</strong>，或者更糟——它和锁服务能通，但和某个下游资源能通，而锁服务的另一个副本认为自己才是权威。</p>\n<p>三节点 Redis 哨兵集群的典型事故：客户端 P 向主节点 A 加锁成功，A 在把这次写入同步到从节点 B 之前宕机。哨兵把 B 提升为新主。P 与 A 一起失去连接，P 的锁在 B 上不存在。另一个客户端 Q 向 B 加锁成功，于是 P 和 Q 同时认为自己在临界区里。<strong>这里没有任何 GC 停顿，没有任何超时误判，锁服务本身也在「正常工作」——只是它在故障切换时丢掉了那次写。</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant P as 客户端 P&#10;    participant A as Redis 主 A&#10;    participant B as Redis 从 B&#10;    participant Q as 客户端 Q&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;A: SET lock P NX PX 10000&#10;    A--&gt;&gt;P: OK(写入仅存在 A 内存)&#10;    Note over A: A 宕机,未同步到 B&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;B: 被提升为新主(丢失 P 的锁)&#10;    Q-&gt;&gt;B: SET lock Q NX PX 10000&#10;    B--&gt;&gt;Q: OK&#10;    Note over P,Q: P 与 Q 同时持有&quot;锁&quot;\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant P as 客户端 P\n    participant A as Redis 主 A\n    participant B as Redis 从 B\n    participant Q as 客户端 Q\n    P-&gt;&gt;A: SET lock P NX PX 10000\n    A--&gt;&gt;P: OK(写入仅存在 A 内存)\n    Note over A: A 宕机,未同步到 B\n    B-&gt;&gt;B: 被提升为新主(丢失 P 的锁)\n    Q-&gt;&gt;B: SET lock Q NX PX 10000\n    B--&gt;&gt;Q: OK\n    Note over P,Q: P 与 Q 同时持有\"锁\"</pre><p>这个模式有三个变体，工程上都会遇到：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>异步复制的丢失窗口</strong>：如上面的场景。Redis 的 <code>WAIT</code> 命令和 <code>min-replicas-to-write</code> 能缩小窗口但不能消除，因为窗口的大小由复制延迟决定，而复制延迟在网络抖动时没有上界。</li>\n<li><strong>脑裂（split-brain）</strong>：网络分区让两个 Redis 主同时存在，各自接受加锁请求。哨兵和 Cluster 都有防护机制，但防护依赖多数派，而多数派本身在分区时可能不存在。</li>\n<li><strong>客户端侧的分区</strong>：P 与锁服务分区，锁在锁服务侧正常过期并被 Q 拿走；P 恢复连通后如果重新执行临界区而不重新加锁（典型的「重试逻辑」缺陷），互斥同样被破坏。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这三种情况指向同一个事实：<strong>互斥的破坏不需要锁服务出错，只需要「锁服务认为锁已释放」和「客户端认为锁仍有效」这两件事在时间上错开</strong>。任何试图通过「让锁服务更可靠」来杜绝这个问题的努力，都会撞上 FLP 不可能性与 CAP 的取舍边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么-本地检查-救不了你\">为什么「本地检查」救不了你</h2><p>面对暂停，一种直觉的补救是让客户端自己在进入临界区前再检查一次锁：「我拿到锁后、真正写数据前，重新读一次锁，还是我的才继续。」这个做法看起来能捕捉到暂停——暂停结束后重新读，发现锁已经不是自己的，于是退出。</p>\n<p>它确实能捕捉到一部分情况，但存在致命的检查间隙：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{read} \\to T_{check} \\to T_{write}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即使读和检查之间只隔了几微秒，这几微秒里进程仍可能被暂停，或者检查所依赖的读本身是过期的（从副本读、读写分离、客户端缓存）。<strong>在异步系统里，任何「先检查后使用」（TOCTOU）的模式都无法被证明安全</strong>，因为检查与使用之间没有原子性保证。检查能降低概率，不能提供正确性。</p>\n<p>真正的解法是把「拒绝过期持有者」的责任放到<strong>下游资源</strong>上——也就是真正被写的数据那里，而不是放在持锁者自己身上。这就是 <a href=\"fencing-token\">Fencing Token</a> 的核心思想：让资源的写入接口校验一个单调递增的令牌，令牌更小的写入被拒绝。这个检查发生在数据所有者的单点、原子位置上，不依赖任何客户端的时钟或自觉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>破坏互斥的不是崩溃，而是<strong>暂停</strong>：GC、虚拟机挂起、CPU 超卖、网络分区都会让一个「活着」的进程失去对锁状态的感知。</li>\n<li>任何客户端都无法消除暂停；能做的只是把「暂停期间锁会怎样」纳入设计。</li>\n<li>互斥被破坏的条件可以量化：当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{gc} + T_{crit} &gt; T_{ttl}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">ttl</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（或临界区被 RPC/IO 拉长）时，锁必然在临界区执行期间过期。</li>\n<li>网络分区的破坏更彻底——不需要暂停，只需要锁服务在故障切换中丢掉一次写，或者脑裂出两个权威。</li>\n<li>「先检查后使用」的本地校验无法提供正确性，只降低概率；正确的兜底必须放在下游资源上（见 <a href=\"fencing-token\">Fencing Token</a>）。</li>\n<li>结论不是「不要用锁」，而是「不要假设锁有效」，并据此设计自动过期（见 <a href=\"lease-heartbeat\">租约与心跳</a>）与写路径保护。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"互斥在 GC/网络分区下如何被破坏","id":"互斥在-gc-网络分区下如何被破坏"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"GC 停顿如何击穿互斥","id":"gc-停顿如何击穿互斥"},{"level":2,"text":"网络分区如何制造双主","id":"网络分区如何制造双主"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么「本地检查」救不了你","id":"为什么-本地检查-救不了你"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"租约与心跳：自动过期的代价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-locks-coordination/why-locks-fail/lease-heartbeat"}}